LICENSING MAP

This repository uses per-directory licensing. The grant for any file is the
LICENSE file in the nearest ancestor directory that contains one, per the
map below. This root file is the authoritative map; the single license badge
GitHub may display is not.

  conventions/          MIT — see conventions/LICENSE
  skills/<name>/        MIT — see the LICENSE file inside each skill folder
  agent/                RESERVED. This directory does not exist yet. When it
                        is created, it will carry its own LICENSE (planned:
                        AGPL-3.0), which will govern its contents exclusively.
  everything else       MIT — the grant in conventions/LICENSE applies
                        (README, repository metadata, dist/ builds of the
                        MIT-licensed skills).

Staging note: grants are staged per the maintainer's working decision and are
to be confirmed before any public release of this repository.
